# Image Editor App

A simple image editing application built using JavaScript that allows users to apply basic filters and adjustments to images directly in the browser. This project focuses on DOM manipulation, CSS filters, and real-time image updates.

## 🚀 Features
- Upload image from local system
- Apply filters like:
  - Brightness
  - Contrast
  - Saturation
  - Blur
  - Grayscale
- Real-time preview of changes
- Reset filters to default values
- Clean and interactive UI

## 🛠 Tech Stack
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript (Vanilla JS)
- CSS Filters
- DOM Manipulation

